                    The
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi 𝒩
                          %mo =
                          %mn 4
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{N}=4
                    SYM Integrable Super Spin Chain
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0307042"} arXiv:hep-th/0307042
          %p
            which led to more detailed matching of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/single+trace+operators"} single trace operators
            to rotating string excitations in
          %ul
            %li#BeisertFrolovStaudacherTseytlin03
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Niklas+Beisert"}> Niklas Beisert
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sergey+Frolov"} Sergey Frolov
              = succeed "," do
